# TestFlight latest build

Before treating an iOS TestFlight install as a failed or broken build:

1. Open TestFlight and confirm the installed build number matches the newest available release.
2. Manually Install/Update if an older build is still installed (TestFlight does not always auto-switch).
3. Do not debug "missing" web/app changes until the latest build is confirmed on-device.
